e spec\n- export onResponseSuccess/onResponseError from web api base.ts so the\n  spec no longer reads axios'' internal handler list\n- reuse mockApis() in tree-list spec; document API_URL coupling\n\nSkipped with reasons: 4 stale AAA comments (already compliant at HEAD),\nsingle-line-test spacing (repo convention), private-method delete\npreview tests (deliberate), avatar length locks (intentional).","tree":{"sha":"743c74e8ec37c8e96030769d185def28112cd88f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/trees/743c74e8ec37c8e96030769d185def28112cd88f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/commits/55c8c8514008c3b84431900894415919d4460db1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91729108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh","id":91729108,"login":"Xayrulloh","node_id":"U_kgDOBXes1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/commit/55c8c8514008c3b84431900894415919d4460db1","node_id":"C_kwDONX4FsNoAKDU1YzhjODUxNDAwOGMzYjg0NDMxOTAwODk0NDE1OTE5ZDQ0NjBkYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/commit/0cb