nal fields, isPublic string→boolean coercion\n- fcm-token.schema.spec.ts: ANDROID/IOS/WEB enum, token min-1\n- notification.schema.spec.ts: content min-5, UUID receiver/sender\n- shared-family-tree.schema.spec.ts: all four boolean permission fields required\n\nNotable findings: Zod v4 UUID validation enforces RFC 4122 variant bits (4th\nsegment must start with 8/9/a/b); dateToString preprocess throws RangeError\non invalid strings rather than returning safeParse failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfde4c1bf1f9317c82cd597a9570ad74fbf4baa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/trees/bfde4c1bf1f9317c82cd597a9570ad74fbf4baa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/commits/6be32e5bc7e6a575df50eeb3c37118c45ae42f55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91729108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh","id":91729108,"login":"Xayrulloh","node_id":"U_kgDOBXes1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/commit/6be32e5bc7e6a575df50eeb3c37118c45ae42f55","node_id":"C_kwDONX4FsNo