users/Xayrulloh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Xayrulloh","id":91729108,"login":"Xayrulloh","node_id":"U_kgDOBXes1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xayrulloh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/commits/14af5b4aece4046607d676cf9d30a9731ed0be35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T12:15:48Z","email":"xayrullohabduvohidov713@gmail.com","name":"Xayrulloh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T12:15:48Z","email":"xayrullohabduvohidov713@gmail.com","name":"Xayrulloh"},"message":"refactor: isolate family-tree routes by owner/public/shared prefix\n\nPhase 2 of the Isolation ticket. Split the unified FamilyTreeAccessGuard into\nprefix-bound OwnerGuard, PublicGuard (no JWT — anonymous/crawler access), and\nSharedAccessGuard. Members and connections become abstract base controllers\n(read tier + write tier) with three thin concrete controllers each at the bare,\n/shared, and /public prefixes. Root tree GET/:id is now owner-only with a new\nGET/:id/public; tree update/delete services made pure (ownership is the guard''s\njob). Cache interceptor matching is prefix-agnostic so all three modes share\nthe same treeId-keyed entry, and anonymous public reads now cache.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e2b1f82f346a2c4ff367ffe2df0ec0ffacc9237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/trees/0e2b1f82f346a2c4ff367ffe2df0ec0ffacc9237"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xayrulloh/Family-Tree/git/commits/14af5b