users/khairul-syazwan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/e5995ea327ffade34ac083eaccbb6b717eff9b45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:01:20Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:01:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vue-mri): disable Rename when the exploration name is empty (#3433)\n\n* fix(vue-mri): disable Rename when the exploration name is empty\n\nThe Rename dialog only checked for an empty name when the user clicked\nRename. The field now shows \"Please enter a name.\" as soon as it is\nempty, and the Rename button stays disabled until the name has text.\nEnter in the field is blocked by the same check.\n\nThe bookmark e2e spec no longer clicks Rename on an empty name; it\nasserts that the button is disabled and the error is visible.\n\nRefs #3122\n\n* refactor(vue-mri): remove comments from the rename guard","tree":{"sha":"41753d4110766a8940e55dc3a6c0f3a17db80dd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/41753d4110766a8940e55dc3a6c0f3a17db80dd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/e5995ea327ffade34ac083eaccbb6b717eff9b45","verification":{"payload":"tree 41753d4110766a8940e55dc3a6c0f3a17db80dd9\nparent f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790906480 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790906480 +0000\n\nfix(vue-mri): disable Rename when the exploration name is empty (#3433)\n\n* fix(vue-mri): disable Rename when the exploration name is empty\n\nThe Rename dialog only checked for an empty name when the user clicked\nRename. The field now shows \"Please enter a name.\" as soon as it is\nempty, and the Rename button stays disabled until the name has text.\nEnter in the field is blocked by the same check.\n\nThe bookmark e2e spec no longer clicks Rename on an empty name; it\nasserts that the button is disabled and the error is visible.\n\nRefs #3122\n\n* refactor(vue-mri): remove comments from the rename guard","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvxCACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfloQAAyOH87xklmzwm6z/XlllUqj\ndn7vEc3BC36s1hIsXGjfAwjX2GvHIaVKobAqW4wy8xHZHaCtcOvBBSmDXrfPUJ4s\n6Rt06V0MKpYdgYYGOkFebYsXx7I55SIaLzbL34N1sYb7qOXrfQlMtKaPZRFAQVDg\ng1HU9ofA2os2C2eU5wg4+1927/7LssN/v/ZGFAfzeadz1ZMS6k8WbBnc8Ozaw8GH\nALj/G8utMRopexUPfRvP8qNJxxYQCIznt7xShBDcO08VsvybcL1BkvAaSviTTY1h\n1/ZMA/mcpU5AF93Ul06FoPPOQt2bpQhopM+3JJ0E4iBvO7MC3IF0EGbIHnFtfxgZ\nxNMZgQ9cVzqAHBsxNTqUzYMpU9DhX2ROK8YHiXIwxtZEp/rjcdFw8e4+zmk/asNY\nV9+UQmYZY9u0CNiBJWTAzzGhSX3CWTWaZKefvwDn30dd6M9w+0p716BlLeXXRjbr\naMTKrDHbgUQegQADXOVAFZGU4YZPWaXGPX9n3uNvcAgJQIEoFa7gbrep//b1mVMy\n9gtbXnv4lFLWpwKikn6KkMDxFe2HcKrUXbtWRaunmhU0wyf3lrfKVwHrDH96zBz1\nGvk3g5ledJoFb+HZPvjzi4efue6grkkiUf+0SqUBtDiFZKNufBlAHJHOLkTlvMh6\nl3S9W4CyuksxRnyeddLx\n=NQPk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:01:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commit/e5995ea327ffade34ac083eaccbb6b717eff9b45","node_id":"C_kwDONZwSsNoAKGU1OTk1ZWEzMjdmZmFkZTM0YWMwODNlYWNjYmI2YjcxN2VmZjliNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commit/f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845","sha":"f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845"}],"sha":"e5995ea327ffade34ac083eaccbb6b717eff9b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/e5995ea327ffade34ac083eaccbb6b717eff9b45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80243918?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khairul-syazwan","id":80243918,"login":"khairul-syazwan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjQzOTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:39:45Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:39:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: show a load error state with Reset column in the patient list (#3434)\n\n* fix: show a load error state with Reset column in the patient list\n\nWhen the patient list request fails, show the designed error state in\nthe table area instead of the one-line error banner. It has the load\nerror illustration, \"Unable to load data\", guidance text, and a Reset\ncolumn button that reverts to the default columns and reloads.\n\nA logged database error also shows its log ID under the text, so users\ncan still quote it to support. The toolbar stays available, so\nShow Default Columns and turning an interaction off also recover.\n\nRefs #3038\n\n* no-mistakes(review): Clear stale patient list load error on no-columns requests\n\n* no-mistakes(document): Note patient list positioning in LoadErrorIllustration comment\n\n* refactor(vue-mri): remove comments from the patient list load error\n\n* fix: match the patient list interaction menu to the design\n\nRestyle the Add Interaction menu of the patient list to the Figma\ndesign: small switches with a 26x10 track and a 16px knob, 40px rows\nwith 16px black labels, a shadowed 250px card, a list that scrolls\ninside 516px, and a pinned Show Default Columns footer under a full\nwidth divider. Empty icons no longer add a gap before the label.\n\nRefs #3038\n\n* no-mistakes(review): Scope Add Interaction menu styles and keep footer hover highlight\n\n* no-mistakes(document): Prettier-format two long i18n strings","tree":{"sha":"db5ae122331d77510bdb122440bc0ba78d5b170a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/db5ae122331d77510bdb122440bc0ba78d5b170a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/f53b4cca5a607ae7bdaa5bc1a24c07b50d0d6845","verification":{"payload":"tree db5ae122331d77510bdb122440bc0ba78d5b170a\nparent f1b6464f3e0f8f88081ff69e309d1652aa746226\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790905185 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790905185 +0000\n\nfix: show a load error state with Reset column in the patient list (#3434)\n\n* fix: show a load error state with Reset column in the patient list\n\nWhen the patient list request fails, show the designed error state in\nthe table area instead of the one-line error banner. It has the load\nerror illustration, \"Unable to load data\", guidance text, and a Reset\ncolumn button that reverts to the default columns and reloads.\n\nA logged database error also shows its log ID under the text, so users\ncan still quote it to support. The toolbar stays available, so\nShow Default Columns and turning an interaction off also recover.\n\nRefs #3038\n\n* no-mistakes(review): Clear stale patient list load error on no-columns requests\n\n* no-mistakes(document): Note patient list positioning in LoadErrorIllustration comment\n\n* refactor(vue-mri): remove comments from the patient list load error\n\n* fix: match the patient list interaction menu to the design\n\nRestyle the Add Interaction menu of the patient list to the Figma\ndesign: small switches with a 26x10 track and a 16px knob, 40px rows\nwith 16px black labels, a shadowed 250px card, a list that scrolls\ninside 516px, and a pinned Show Default Columns footer under a full\nwidth divider. Empty icons no longer add a gap before the label.\n\nRefs #3038\n\n* no-mistakes(review): Scope Add Interaction menu styles and keep footer hover highlight\n\n* no-mistakes(document): Prettier-format two long i18n strings","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvwtwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQNcQAEBGMbMNM7AMEjNIB7wjOKUM\n8Qk4F2v7UEzrH1HaJvRnH2qutc+n6TpYzi+n8J+FOmj