ravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khairul-syazwan","id":80243918,"login":"khairul-syazwan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjQzOTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/1d0c5da99ccc9d174f7ff934936a2caf6564e8ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:38:54Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:38:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(wizards): keep the Atlas mount props and match the data source select (#3424)\n\n* fix(wizards): keep the Atlas mount props and match the data source select\n\nAtlas3 updates its plugin parcels with { hostContext } only, and single-spa\nreplaces parcel props on update. After the first update, the Wizard lost\nisAtlas, getToken, appId and authContext. It then used the portal layout\n(nested grey panel and white card), hid the data source selector, and sent\nthe wizard config request without a datasetId.\n\n- Keep the mount props per parcel and merge them into each update and\n  unmount (keepMountPropsOnUpdate).\n- Load the wizard list again when isAtlas changes.\n- Replace the native data source select with an MUI outlined select that\n  matches D2eSelect in Data Exploration: tokens, 48px height, menu row\n  colours for hover and selected.\n- Show the form step data source as the same field, read-only.\n\nRefs #3419\n\n* no-mistakes(document): docs(wizards): note update lifecycle keeps mount props\n\n* test(wizards): run keepMountPropsOnUpdate through single-spa parcels\n\nMount the wrapped lifecycles with mountRootParcel and update with\n{ hostContext } only, as Atlas3 does. single-spa gives every lifecycle call\nthe parcel''s own name, so the update finds the mount props. A second case\nshows that single-spa drops the mount props without the wrapper.","tree":{"sha":"d7d792e3ca435cfdd705cd5c50fadfbc1c458428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/d7d792e3ca435cfdd705cd5c50fadfbc1c458428"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/1d0c5da99ccc9d174f7ff934936a2caf6564e8ed","verification":{"payload":"tree d7d792e3ca435cfdd705cd5c50fadfbc1c458428\nparent 035d9c6178dd70d4768a955e61f54eeef01a3523\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790732334 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790732334 +0000\n\nfix(wizards): keep the Atlas mount props and match the data source select (#3424)\n\n* fix(wizards): keep the Atlas mount props and match the data source select\n\nAtlas3 updates its plugin parcels with { hostContext } only, and single-spa\nreplaces parcel props on update. After the first update, the Wizard lost\nisAtlas, getToken, appId and authContext. It then used the portal layout\n(nested grey panel and white card), hid the data source selector, and sent\nthe wizard config request without a datasetId.\n\n- Keep the mount props per parcel and merge them into each update and\n  unmount (keepMountPropsOnUpdate).\n- Load the wizard list again when isAtlas changes.\n- Replace the native data source select with an MUI outlined select that\n  matches D2eSelect in Data Exploration: tokens, 48px height, menu row\n  colours for hover and selected.\n- Show the form step data source as the same field, read-only.\n\nRefs #3419\n\n* no-mistakes(document): docs(wizards): note update lifecycle keeps mount props\n\n* test(wizards): run keepMountPropsOnUpdate through single-spa parcels\n\nMount the wrapped lifecycles with mountRootParcel and update with\n{ hostContext } only, as Atlas3 does. single-spa gives every lifecycle call\nthe parcel''s own name, so the update finds the mount props. A second case\nshows that single-spa drops the mount props without the wrapper.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvGg+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6YcQALH93+v+yeE3RD7w9NkONuqW\nh644zWGR4nZ0vc4HR94VRgvzzRuNOS5GpBzCYrlx4mtYl9p2NY4oXWpHOf2FyPYd\nGaYhhZibbvVG+nh6jtHBEa0j8O8zFOQzsNE1Ea6UMOFkMUX6BaqMIgVh6BXk0frD\nbgsJcjNI7ODLq6epS5kWaOTmCZQOxpkO6iMK8QVw0e+Ou5hB0V2VCLAcHoaZSs8T\ncE8ySIJsZVSt7gBZ3EJj5ymo9qjliIQzewUX0pt0J19XA+PM6QbpwDn09pMkEnC5\n9m0gRCo5p7LPLt96Rl4GDZna+DkLX/bftXj+ij0FNxdVvaBeTrfPay7V7m4AkIEk\nbBjvqVVvI05eF3Z3bcAa5qsAE2hTDNcAfDEJA3uP3vVwmTsj6NgCCh8wy665LnyB\n2imvcNLAW/qLDeDBbuVl/IBrLs9mVZmQVRpRw18kmaZTaGG0VO3K0MFH2NVNF+HU\nAyWgp3qQ/e8l7JyRaiIaH6HSYicdJuDrygSwUiDbPblO/zhBVs3UySX/rk4XVE9f\nyJ1MIqMOWDwhIvZqPoedTslVC/MxsN2SU0vWX1h51OJ4nLMdw9SnQas5yUxEHZmy\n+lp1MkwhecZkUQkC6MT75/N6uUoqiRlMM9gZ9WbzvWIMlW6X8oZy5Bp+F89KYU+I\nOo+g4JFsZpMwj2v40C08\n=S7fo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T01:39:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owne