rul-syazwan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khairul-syazwan","id":80243918,"login":"khairul-syazwan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjQzOTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/8fa35d08e5cd39fcff0a91da04a55e6710526507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:21:38Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:21:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[D2E Redesign | Exploration] Rename \"Allow sharing\" checkbox label to \"Enable sharing\" (#3418)\n\n* fix: rename \"Allow sharing\" checkbox label to \"Enable sharing\"\n\nThe label read like a permission grant to another user. The checkbox\nshares the exploration when it is ticked, so \"Enable sharing\" states the\naction and matches the tooltip wording (\"When enabled\").\n\nGerman and Chinese labels change the same way, to match their tooltips.\nThe tooltip text does not change.\n\nRefs #3403\n\n* ci(e2e): let one run regenerate the screenshot baselines\n\nTEMPORARY. Revert with the baselines.\n\nThe \"Enable sharing\" label shows in the 09-patient-analytics screenshot\nbaselines, so they drift. Let CI write the new ones:\n- mount tests/, because the image bakes the tests in and the container\n  is --rm, so the new baselines would stay inside it\n- add --update-snapshots=changed\n- upload the result as regenerated-baselines-attempt-<n>\n\nWith -u every comparison passes, so this job is green for free. It\nproves nothing until these changes come out again.\n\nSame approach as bad953a91.\n\n* test(e2e): take CI''s regenerated baselines, and undo the temporary CI changes\n\nThe baselines come from attempt 2 of CI run 36384189572. That attempt\npassed with no failures (51 passed, 21 skipped), and\ncohort-entry-and-exit passed, so no PA config leaked into later specs.\n\n21 baselines change: example-1, cohort-entry-and-exit 1-2,\nextended-query-logic 1-3, and filtering-barchart 1-15. Each shows the\n\"Enable sharing\" label.\n\nThis reverts 69e3d6ccf, so the e2e step compares against baselines again.","tree":{"sha":"00fd85f565ac0423046086a2d73256022af64acb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/00fd85f565ac0423046086a2d73256022af64acb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/8fa35d08e5cd39fcff0a91da04a55e6710526507","verification":{"payload":"tree 00fd85f565ac0423046086a2d73256022af64acb\nparent f02d07f9ded73f7a6b551b2d848dfd93d66b475d\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790652098 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790652098 +0000\n\n[D2E Redesign | Exploration] Rename \"Allow sharing\" checkbox label to \"Enable sharing\" (#3418)\n\n* fix: rename \"Allow sharing\" checkbox label to \"Enable sharing\"\n\nThe label read like a permission grant to another user. The checkbox\nshares the exploration when it is ticked, so \"Enable sharing\" states the\naction and matches the tooltip wording (\"When enabled\").\n\nGerman and Chinese labels change the same way, to match their tooltips.\nThe tooltip text does not change.\n\nRefs #3403\n\n* ci(e2e): let one run regenerate the screenshot baselines\n\nTEMPORARY. Revert with the baselines.\n\nThe \"Enable sharing\" label shows in the 09-patient-analytics screenshot\nbaselines, so they drift. Let CI write the new ones:\n- mount tests/, because the image bakes the tests in and the container\n  is --rm, so the new baselines would stay inside it\n- add --update-snapshots=changed\n- upload the result as regenerated-baselines-attempt-<n>\n\nWith -u every comparison passes, so this job is green for free. It\nproves nothing until these changes come out again.\n\nSame approach as bad953a91.\n\n* test(e2e): take CI''s regenerated baselines, and undo the temporary CI changes\n\nThe baselines come from attempt 2 of CI run 36384189572. That attempt\npassed with no failures (51 passed, 21 skipped), and\ncohort-entry-and-exit passed, so no PA config leaked into later specs.\n\n21 baselines change: example-1, cohort-entry-and-exit 1-2,\nextended-query-logic 1-3, and filtering-barchart 1-15. Each shows the\n\"Enable sharing\" label.\n\nThis reverts 69e3d6ccf, so the e2e step compares against baselines again.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquz16CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjjcQAK+YQN5WjdeaA/nzrN2x/TFr\nWuMms4EzAD9AztjeOyH0Pk1sjEKAMMtTTBuiDZ26q8+JNNduX/nCSadcy9xnAbPu\nYAqZ/s4r1sStdEUaN1jGLbf3G/VO3Q4MTUBiRyTNj4nbTcLVAxnKp5H0Hq2fns3N\nDaZOohmrn/Wpmv5KGuqZH6mmRxZRbnoXrAu9gQEcN/4Vw2FYgix+o0o5n9LR1dcs\nyn5sbPMEGozErTgU6KJ+Hy3u0XOYZI5LuUgK6u/H7JbYHll2sAyhfVpY/JESs+e/\n0kZ1vGU5PhQvkMv3oXdzmIbIDQIBavdQJRhrk7hNcCPpzEifY7wlu02cKiePVMiE\npZeSPQ7UGsz0LL6dNoxHB0D/eNFy21BI/ypsH4tHBDarEW292o4S+gveAUVI8Gbe\nVHjutj13Aa/UiHj6vQcSJV6MUiizMNriqirgKeD8IrmjC1j+G3s+3QJBbaQl3r7a\nBCRqueU0vzEmXpSqtp/UqJlPe0E5odjV8k3nm6uB+PGl3AzK3Y9qq8uqfzycKHAZ\nLTz4xim9MRKaz4jic5Tc+kA0bBoyRwnwxcfvx6fg/y5qnoibXBqMaHZEMeUZXGyE\nXDgnprKtz1y8vxyZQGfJI7k1njewemXoeou6o6tQHPc2J3q5nNUWHYcEjU/lMkHu\nnEGmpjNwviTUp1tLnmB0\n=dDD2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T04:24:27Z"}},"committ