ta2Evidence/commits/20d6f0b650f18a2671a4103e149f0c0e6d85599a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80243918?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khairul-syazwan","id":80243918,"login":"khairul-syazwan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjQzOTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/57cdc8dc03ce536e19b481e733eec27fe8f4c0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:47:11Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:47:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(wizards): spell out the Respiratory Rate field label (#3384)\n\n* fix(wizards): spell out the Respiratory Rate field label\n\nThe Vitals section showed the abbreviated \"Resp Rate\". Every neighbouring\nvitals label is written in full, and the field maps to the OMOP concept\n\"Respiratory rate\", so the abbreviation is the odd one out.\n\nRename the label in both shipped config templates, in the dev-only mock\ndefinitions, and in the config fixture the wizard e2e spec uploads. Both\nsurfaces read field.label from the same config, so this covers the wizard\ntab and the Patient Analytics wizard form.\n\nThe label is served from the stored PA config, so an environment that\nalready has a wizard config needs the updated template uploaded through\nSettings -> PA Config -> Wizards.\n\n* no-mistakes(document): docs: move template re-upload note to its owner section","tree":{"sha":"46ba918bb1ce2db88de255fd31e9169a12788cb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/46ba918bb1ce2db88de255fd31e9169a12788cb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/57cdc8dc03ce536e19b481e733eec27fe8f4c0d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 46ba918bb1ce2db88de255fd31e9169a12788cb9\nparent 15647adfc347d1451cd68d442ce731b2f2597680\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790063231 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790063231 +0000\n\nfix(wizards): spell out the Respiratory Rate field label (#3384)\n\n* fix(wizards): spell out the Respiratory Rate field label\n\nThe Vitals section showed the abbreviated \"Resp Rate\". Every neighbouring\nvitals label is written in full, and the field maps to the OMOP concept\n\"Respiratory rate\", so the abbreviation is the odd one out.\n\nRename the label in both shipped config templates, in the dev-only mock\ndefinitions, and in the config fixture the wizard e2e spec uploads. Both\nsurfaces read field.label from the same config, so this covers the wizard\ntab and the Patient Analytics wizard form.\n\nThe label is served from the stored PA config, so an environment that\nalready has a wizard config needs the updated template uploaded through\nSettings -> PA Config -> Wizards.\n\n* no-mistakes(document): docs: move template re-upload note to its owner section","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqskZTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASdcQAEGemcKlDahtCJMjJDv5EIg4\nNNBglwH6KLNe4vEcMybijiuggsOHZRVzoTDGteOS7xAU7/hINYSSEgO/e1XiJ4aV\nGi69V4h8LL5VfJyv8UCadr9Icdnh3kYWqb