://github.com/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commit/b4fd1a595fc9cfb8181cbcf6e01f04b2ac6af3a2","sha":"b4fd1a595fc9cfb8181cbcf6e01f04b2ac6af3a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/b4fd1a595fc9cfb8181cbcf6e01f04b2ac6af3a2"}],"sha":"519c96427e5d75457931e18549a1408709556774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/519c96427e5d75457931e18549a1408709556774"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48011859?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/suwarnoong","id":48011859,"login":"suwarnoong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDExODU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/b4fd1a595fc9cfb8181cbcf6e01f04b2ac6af3a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:20:29Z","email":"48011859+suwarnoong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"suwarno ong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:20:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(datasource): inherit shell theme instead of overwriting it (#3351)\n\nThe datasource plugin created Vuetify via buildVuetifyOptions(), which\nships a full `atlas` theme (primary #1f425a) on Vuetify''s default, shared\nstylesheetId. On mount it overwrote the Atlas3 shell''s\n<style id=\"vuetify-theme-stylesheet\"> with its own :root palette, repainting\nthe whole app''s primary colour app-wide (visible when opening\n/plugins/datasources/, and persisting after navigating away).\n\nPass theme:false so the plugin inherits the shell''s :root tokens and writes\nnothing to the shared stylesheet; spread keeps buildVuetifyOptions'' component\ndefaults (density, variants). Same pattern as the data-quality sub-plugin.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"870a3c075ad347d30eb376c6b9d3b54cd0d890b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/870a3c075ad347d30eb376c6b9d3b54cd0d890b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/b4fd1a595fc9cfb8181cbcf6e01f04b2ac6af3a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 870a3c075ad347d30eb376c6b9d3b54cd0d890b2\nparent 47e95ab26cedd77cfc0ed985a12c7553c0fdf73c\nauthor suwarno ong <48011859+suwarnoong@users.noreply.github.com> 1789636829 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789636829 +0000\n\nfix(datasource): inherit shell theme instead of overwriting it (#3351)\n\nThe datasource plugin created Vuetify via buildVuetifyOptions(), which\nships a full `atlas` theme (primary #1f425a) on Vuetify''s default, shared\nstylesheetId. On mount it overwrote the Atlas3 shell''s\n<style id=\"vuetify-theme-stylesheet\"> with its own :root palette, repainting\nthe whole app''s primary colour app-wide (visible when opening\n/plugins/datasources/, and persisting after navigating away).\n\nPass theme:false so the plugin inherits the shell''s :root tokens and writes\nnothing to the shared stylesheet; spread keeps buildVuetifyOptions'' component\ndefaults (density, variants). Same pattern as the data-quality sub-plugin.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq7DsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFAMQAEjfflRnOwt1z36AsWVNSTqk\nQZx/6eYTW