/exit for PA webmcp (#3273)\n\n* keep advanced time in sync with the stored time filters\n\n* flag the patient count as stale while chart query in flight\n\n* add time relations, entry/exit and date-range warnings to cohort patch\n\n* expose time relations, entry/exit and a blocking result read via webmcp tools\n\n* revert cosmetic change\n\n* apply code review comments\n\n* fix unit tests","tree":{"sha":"73b93480efbd7682b1fe357927165dc614b4f6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/73b93480efbd7682b1fe357927165dc614b4f6b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/88647e8315ac2f3194ae41bea3283e2943b962aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 73b93480efbd7682b1fe357927165dc614b4f6b2\nparent 6c7746df10f8515d52b37ea65e1c0c4f8c96417d\nauthor Maggie Li Yundi <maggie.li@data4life-asia.care> 1789528571 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789528571 +0000\n\nfeat(webmcp): add support for advanced time relations and cohort entry/exit for PA webmcp (#3273)\n\n* keep advanced time in sync with the stored time filters\n\n* flag the patient count as stale while chart query in flight\n\n* add time relations, entry/exit and date-range warnings to cohort patch\n\n* expose time relations, entry/exit and a blocking result read via webmcp tools\n\n* revert cosmetic change\n\n* apply code review comments\n\n* fix unit tests","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqgoLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtUYQAK3JPv8wLKQjSVGRzr85h9Bh\nBAnpezeLhPkhCeXKWrkVoG22pickczUiEskVzSklImufbKSddsjB1sIG5cVLzhLD\nkyx9iN66sTIbxAI174rCU6VYUFj+bj0zgrqlxu1DWGFjhLFvTPtZpkRwkwnvJGd+\nUT2DhECTbc82QpJoaaalbgY2umNPw3qah75dBqeo7T8cT0jEcpUdTjtLy3AptsdY\nmzc9427qiG71XtSnf9j0r9Iwt6yVHDU9CcKhayU2CTua0RXJ8nsBOpTlX/Cj8Eem\n6JYxyAuh/9GZSjF5e71bhgtj7J6v3WZJCS4JkDd6RVshqxpB7eJF8FFBJFMA5Hjc\ntqNBCP/yxS+dbidiVbBY121Zsqf2non5VwuI2Jefwdvj2b6fyP65cyet7ahcAW6z\nO4g8n3armbK4fyH6u4p8KqB/bpZY3s22IqIjqN7p6+EB88ngde5cMwemKWmH2JFl\nuGL25gHRhKtwtMkYJXvze