lowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/suwarnoong","id":48011859,"login":"suwarnoong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDExODU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suwarnoong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/6c7746df10f8515d52b37ea65e1c0c4f8c96417d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:54:22Z","email":"48011859+suwarnoong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"suwarno ong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:54:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Integrate-3106] Add datasource plugin with Description screen (#3196)\n\n* 3106 Add datasource plugin with Description screen\n\n* feat(datasource): add Data Sources catalog overview\n\nFold the D2E Data Sources overview into the datasource plugin, reusing his\nAPI/auth/AccessState. His Description detail view is untouched.\n\n- Card-grid overview: banner, search, \"Sort by\" dropdown menu, and cards with\n  Public + access badges (have/pending/no-access), styled to the Figma.\n- Reuses his getUserGroupList / getMyStudyAccessRequests / getIdpUserId; adds\n  getDatasetList / getPublicDatasetList + a catalog composable for list-level\n  access resolution, sort, and search.\n- Card click opens Atlas3''s native Data Sources report view\n  (#/datasources/reports/<sourceKey>), where his Description shows in the sidebar.\n- Banner image + tagline from the public config/public/header-image and\n  config/public/overview-description endpoints (admin-configurable).\n- Overview list limited to WebAPI and HANA datasets.\n- plugins.standalone.json: register the catalog nav for the datasource plugin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(datasource): fix catalog application-mount bugs, align URLs to /datasources\n\n* feat(datasource): add Files and Metadata sections to Description screen\n\n* feat(datasource): wire the plugin into the Atlas build pipeline\n\n* Update data source list page and footer\n\n* perf(datasource): externalize vue from the plugin bundle\n\n* fix(datasource): fix GitHub Packages auth and build datasource to a local dist-atlas dir\n\n* Update icon from filled to outlined\n\n* Fix build and add gitignore\n\n* fix(datasource): apply deployment API prefix, fix access-state races, disable dead request-access flow\n\n* fix(datasource): update readme\n\n* fix(datasource): sync bun.lock with pinned @ohdsi/atlas-ui version\n\nCommit 8d47a22 pinned @ohdsi/atlas-ui to 0.1.0-20260721210553-c51900d in\ndatasource/package.json without regenerating plugins/ui/bun.lock, which\nstill recorded 0.1.0-20260820162528-77a7c15. The mismatch is invisible on\nthe pull_request event (the portal FE test''s paths filter only watches\napps/portal), but the merge_group event runs ''bun install'' unconditionally\nwith a frozen lockfile and fails before any test runs.\n\n* ci(ui): authenticate to GitHub Packages in plugins/ui test workflows\n\nThe datasource app adds a private @ohdsi/atlas-ui dependency to the\nplugins/ui bun workspace, so ''bun install'' now needs GitHub Packages auth.\nThe three workflows that install the workspace (portal FE, portal\ncomponents, vue) had no token, so their merge_group runs 401 on the\natlas-ui download. Grant ''packages: read'' and pass GITHUB_TOKEN /\nNODE_AUTH_TOKEN (consumed by plugins/ui/.npmrc), matching the datasource\nbuild in docker-build-push.yaml.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: hengxian-jiang <hengxian.jiang@u.nus.edu>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdeedb5f81aea22d8ff094a4829915f52e74e992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/fdeedb5f81aea22d8ff094a4829915f52e74e992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/6c7746df10f8515d52b37ea65e1c0c4f8c96417d","verification":{"payload":"tree fdeedb5f81aea22d8ff094a4829915f52e74e992\nparent 8193fc6718ed996dcb8be0c23cc11a71aac21d72\nauthor suwarno ong <48011859+suwarnoong@users.noreply.github.com> 1789455262 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789455262 +0000\n\n[Integrate-3106] Add datasource plugin with Description screen (#3196)\n\n* 3106 Add datasource plugin with Description screen\n\n* feat(datasource): add Data Sources catalog overview\n\nFold the D2E Data Sources overview into the datasource plugin, reusing his\nAPI/auth/AccessState. His Description detail view is untouched.\n\n- Card-grid overview: banner, search, \"Sort by\" dropdown menu, and cards with\n  Public + access badges (have/pending/no-access), styled to the Figma.\n- Reuses his getUserGroupList / getMyStudyAccessRequests / getIdpUserId; adds\n  getDatasetList / getPublicDatasetList + a catalog composable for list-level\n  access resolution, sort, and search.\n- Card click opens Atlas3''s native Data Sources report view\n  (#/datasources/reports/<sourceKey>), where his Description shows in the sidebar.\n- Banner image + tagline from the public config/public/header-image and\n  config/public/overview-description endpoints (admin-configurable).\n- Overview list limited to WebAPI and HANA datasets.\n- plugins.standalone.json: register the catalog nav for the datasource plugin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(datasource): fix catalog application-mount bugs, align URLs to /datasources\n\n* feat(datasource): add Files and Metadata sections to Description screen\n\n* feat(datasource): wire the plugin into the Atlas build pipeline\n\n* Update data source list page and footer\n\n* perf(datasource): externalize vue from the plugin bundle\n\n* fix(datasource): fix GitHub Packages auth and build datasource to a local dist-atlas dir\n\n* Update icon from filled to outlined\n\n* Fix build and add gitignore\n\n* fix(datasource): apply deployment API prefix, fix access-state races, disable dead request-access flow\n\n* fix(datasource): update readme\n\n* fix(datasource): sync bun.lock with pinned @ohdsi/atlas-ui version\n\nCommit 8d47a22 pinned @ohdsi/atlas-ui to 0.1.0-20260721210553-c51900d in\ndatasource/package.json without regenerating plugins/ui/bun.lock, which\nstill recorded 0.1.0-20260820162528-77a7c15. The mismatch is invisible on\nthe pull_request event (the portal FE test''s paths filter only watches\napps/portal), but the merge_group event runs ''bun install'' unconditionally\nwith a frozen lockfile and fails before any test runs.\n\n* ci(ui): authenticate to GitHub Packages in plugins/ui test workflows\n\nThe datasource app adds a private @ohdsi/atlas-ui dependency to the\nplugins/ui bun workspace, so ''bun install'' now needs GitHub Packages auth.\nThe three workflows that install the workspace (portal FE, portal\ncomponents, vue) had no token, so their merge_group runs 401 on the\natlas-ui download. Grant ''packages: read'' and pass GITHUB_TOKEN /\nNODE_AUTH_TOKEN (consumed by plugins/ui/.npmrc), matching the datasource\nbuild in docker-build-push.yaml.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: hengxian-jiang <hengxian.jiang@u.nus.edu>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqOuuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAetsQAI8+eTrb7cMFTw50umW8un1M\n3EsK+KYwY2cflE8ZTUWHopECmUkhqS62mKfr9SvKVLs1XVY7o/Ke/b44pjcdfRli\njFOLOC1NjmSFrgxPVu/FPmXLg6TU6E2CrkOOr3RkzyZ8cUHtfZBpRVEG1kpaGU