tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khairul-syazwan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commits/d0ebce09ccb3c65a83c76431e69a01f9487a7b5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:55:09Z","email":"80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Khairul Syazwan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:55:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(pa): show save/delete cohort toast after the modal closes (#3210)\n\n* fix(pa): show save/delete cohort toast after the modal closes\n\nThe success feedback for saving or deleting a cohort was fired while the\nconfirm modal was still open. It rendered below the modal overlay\n(z-index 1000) and its 2s auto-dismiss could expire before the modal\nclosed, so the user saw no feedback (most visible on the slower v0.18\ninstance).\n\nChanges:\n- Raise the app toast above modal overlays (z-index 100000).\n- Close the delete dialog right after the delete succeeds, before the\n  post-delete list refresh, so the toast appears after the dialog closes.\n- Defer the save toast to after the save/update succeeds by suppressing\n  the store''s inline toast (suppressToast) and firing it after the dialog\n  closes; also disable the Save button while the save is in flight.\n\n* fix(pa): address Copilot review on cohort save/delete feedback\n\n- Guard FiltersFooter.saveBookmark against re-entry so a pending save\n  cannot be started again via the name-input Enter key.\n- Rethrow failed materialized/Atlas/D2E cohort deletes so the delete\n  dialog stays open on failure instead of closing and losing the\n  error context.\n- Suppress the premature materialize success toast in SaveCohortModal\n  (pass suppressToast to onAddCohortOkButtonPress) so only the\n  post-modal-close success notification is shown.","tree":{"sha":"2142c268d8561dab4be938c8970664729e6da516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/trees/2142c268d8561dab4be938c8970664729e6da516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/git/commits/d0ebce09ccb3c65a83c76431e69a01f9487a7b5e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2142c268d8561dab4be938c8970664729e6da516\nparent 3b5331921d9ce22d3a6109c54aeb0f01e24e4fe4\nauthor Khairul Syazwan <80243918+khairul-syazwan@users.noreply.github.com> 1788317709 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788317709 +0000\n\nfix(pa): show save/delete cohort toast after the modal closes (#3210)\n\n* fix(pa): show save/delete cohort toast after the modal closes\n\nThe success feedback for saving or deleting a cohort was fired while the\nconfirm modal was still open. It rendered below the modal overlay\n(z-index 1000) and its 2s auto-dismiss could expire before the modal\nclosed, so the user saw no feedback (most visible on the slower v0.18\ninstance).\n\nChanges:\n- Raise the app toast above modal overlays (z-index 100000).\n- Close the delete dialog right after the delete succeeds, before the\n  post-delete list refresh, so the toast appears after the dialog closes.\n- Defer the save toast to after the save/update succeeds by suppressing\n  the store''s inline toast (suppressToast) and firing it after the dialog\n  closes; also disable the Save button while the save is in flight.\n\n* fix(pa): address Copilot review on cohort save/delete feedback\n\n- Guard FiltersFooter.saveBookmark against re-entry so a pending save\n  cannot be started again via the name-input Enter key.\n- Rethrow failed materialized/Atlas/D2E cohort deletes so the delete\n  dialog stays open on failure instead of closing and losing the\n  error context.\n- Suppress the premature materialize success toast in SaveCohortModal\n  (pass suppressToast to onAddCohortOkButtonPress) so only the\n  post-modal-close success notification is shown.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql5AdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYHwQAEmCLvC8Jl6gI6dK769L0Q6J\nYlF/VEIa+gB/BsEFq64esewh4L+E8MFmaEBlrXw9FwG1bVnuPf/Izut5aMB5xQGa\n8GF2xpa1EwqBxAIiztsIOSTKm7vHVwSVUkuH2bQS38JYG2ix+EOjEgNdpTYbR2K+\nLYH4HnLtHov24Jpx1yAYRUHt/5WbKLY3ETzFzAXW+siCjw9IjaKcyDenGIGO4/A0\nC3jVa5zEktPWt6rwMxHvWJ3pdRvslO/1TC4OAvNTV/BIPDHTjhxrQBYOiAA3eYsI\nU6wlvJkAxrx1sRUsh3Bqn+1N9c2Xjy0UvMTEcIO3QFBJM4hPjjHpe47VtjMxVB5Q\nQVsJNxvw82WTXZwvcwj7JXu81mlwz+2Y5Y0DpOngJEeJ7WHj1D0NevYraJoCc345\niqL0nsz32f8I0Vxfhu6YHVPKseP5BUJsuUqWtsXg/bKtZljidTuP0+Midjm7PQZI\n1OTeUbWRBB8cp8yJuLHLdxdKi7QPtnCQAS7I+cNg0dxJMXN8hctw9wCN5BysgW36\n3KeHna1YTsgeCFin9kWtV8ek+L5064Q5oJTG0+d14mtbW/3hh+VWT1C7supuV0IK\nrlkQVzgbvdkCcRRGFg0SasgCRF/gjBSOhEKeG6bPhdEIK9CpSLfKIYkUqYRxdydQ\nV/vcrivvYfeMqWboAftl\n=kIA0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T02:55:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Data2Evidence/commit/d0ebce09ccb3c65a83c76431e69a01f9487a7b5e","node_id":"C_kwDONZwSsNoAKGQwZWJjZTA5Y2NiM2M2