mjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T13:11:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Chore/agentic workflows decouple (#102)\n\n* chore: decouple agentic workflows to care-agentic-workflows\n\n- All agentic .md sources now pinned via ''source: ohcnetwork/care-agentic-workflows/...@main''\n  (canonical sources live in the new repo; refresh with ''gh aw update'')\n- GitHub App token (vars.CARE_AW_APP_ID + secrets.CARE_AW_APP_PRIVATE_KEY) replaces\n  the GH_AW_AGENT_TOKEN PAT everywhere; PAT kept only as optional precedence\n  override for the @copilot rework hand-back comment\n- qa-bootstrap-enroll: shift-left gate — PRs enter state:needs-qa only when\n  deterministic CI (lint/tests/build) is green on the head commit\n- new glue: state-ledger.yml (append-only per-PR state history comment),\n  gh-aw-drift-check.yml (fails CI when lock files drift from sources)\n- new agentic workflow: needs-human-triage (pinned triage issue for parked PRs)\n- daily-repo-status: QA-pipeline observability section (throughput, rework loops,\n  watchdog interventions, parked PRs, run durations)\n- thank-you-note: checkout disabled (pwn-request hardening)\n- lock files recompiled with gh aw compile --approve\n\n* chore: point agentic workflow source pins at amjithtitus09/care-agentic-workflows\n\n* chore: use GH_AW_AGENT_TOKEN PAT for agentic workflow writes (drop GitHub App)","tree":{"sha":"4aaf2b62a14035d4fd40b3b5d50200f65cd4a31f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/4aaf2b62a14035d4fd40b3b5d50200f65cd4a31f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/01294013d12f8ffaef1717d0b625874e33442dcb","verification":{"payload":"tree 4aaf2b62a14035d4fd40b3b5d50200f65cd4a31f\nparent 047ba4f11a5a7211aa7df999ebf24c4f879fa35f\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1783948296 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783948296 +0530\n\nChore/agentic workflows decouple (#102)\n\n* chore: decouple agentic workflows to care-agentic-workflows\n\n- All agentic .md sources now pinned via ''source: ohcnetwork/care-agentic-workflows/...@main''\n  (canonical sources live in the new repo; refresh with ''gh aw update'')\n- GitHub App token (vars.CARE_AW_APP_ID + secrets.CARE_AW_APP_PRIVATE_KEY) replaces\n  the GH_AW_AGENT_TOKEN PAT everywhere; PAT kept only as optional precedence\n  override for the @copilot rework hand-back comment\n- qa-bootstrap-enroll: shift-left gate — PRs enter state:needs-qa only when\n  deterministic CI (lint/tests/build) is green on the head commit\n- new glue: state-ledger.yml (append-only per-PR state history comment),\n  gh-aw-drift-check.yml (fails CI when lock files drift from sources)\n- new agentic workflow: needs-human-triage (pinned triage issue for parked PRs)\n- daily-repo-status: QA-pipeline observability section (throughput, rework loops,\n  watchdog interventions, parked PRs, run durations)\n- thank-you-note: checkout disabled (pwn-request hardening)\n- lock files recompiled with gh aw compile --approve\n\n* chore: point agentic workflow source pins at amjithtitus09/care-agentic-workflows\n\n* chore: use GH_AW_AGENT_TOKEN PAT for agentic workflow writes (drop GitHub App)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVOQICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI4UQABZ/7hUOlh8GTSH7ganWvAxn\nHYZnm5gFC0Q5O/DoqlF8piXH7uyW1JZ9PwSlfFgCTeMwp5Bpyk/HIuacLnsm8XwW\nRtQG3q9sKGsxm8LDWP8K31WKDoDD9x75xNs+ZcKqtJ5Q9RK1i6F1w4Ju0RvYP18E\nFbJaBNl7na5J3mFomMNQJPo2HeDEOKVo6nqY3nvQSV+FGPUWJLHaONB/+UMZlAzc\n4hB7Hp8yZgvhu062BRkJ+X3DaP/NnEaThD/JY9TK6BYTJ4brSXibQnyLFMrRFbBh\n+YP7ADbrOSK5qMxIux7OumPUJGabwFhGBktvQYN/OWQeHrlH157qxLedDokBBeaL\nE2yu7U1zQiiBS02FBiho5pobANxAJ5rQNj1iIx12HoAsYnRHLvxHUrsgn7k1fhgt\nxozOOrle+A3IHGdJbD/D3TlfHRcwKf0AkzXkv7/NnSc9mSXq4lIHSxq3fOT8NyWw\nqaVCvN7OXudG0rXkrefzoAMUDHbrWWcFWS8p9bqtJmK8wiBa9giIE9TIlFtR7GN/\nn9xqdQ0YS9igmyXCR3OoSRxG9XE2tJsfS6DzqcREJP5wad6PSXvJzRgrLo1SV4kt\n48adS8/