users/amjithtitus09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09","id":37619282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/047ba4f11a5a7211aa7df999ebf24c4f879fa35f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:17:30Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:17:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(qa): cap Visual QA retries in watchdog, escalate to needs-human (#92)\n\nThe QA watchdog reset any PR stuck in state:qa-running back to\nstate:needs-qa unconditionally, so a Visual QA run that keeps crashing\n(e.g. on a model-inference 403) looped forever, roughly every 2 hours.\n\nGive each PR a bounded retry budget of 3 total attempts (the initial\nrun plus at most 2 watchdog retries). The watchdog counts the retries\nit has already granted from a hidden marker in its own reset comments;\nonce the budget is spent it escalates the PR to the terminal\nstate:needs-human instead of resetting it again.\n\nPrompt change lives in qa-watchdog.md (runtime-imported); the lock is\nrecompiled so its body_hash matches. No other workflow behavior changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"53a0a1621c0a0cc8697d5cbd99f9c41bc660ffb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/53a0a1621c0a0cc8697d5cbd99f9c41bc660ffb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/047ba4f11a5a7211aa7df999ebf24c4f879fa35f","verification":{"payload":"tree 53a0a1621c0a0cc8697d5cbd99f9c41bc660ffb8\nparent b1ff03d4c6e2fe986ee78167abfad026f3c6cb88\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782890250 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782890250 +0530\n\nci(qa): cap Visual QA retries in watchdog, escalate to needs-human (#92)\n\nThe QA watchdog reset any PR stuck in state:qa-running back to\nstate:needs-qa unconditionally, so a Visual QA run that keeps crashing\n(e.g. on a model-inference 403) looped forever, roughly every 2 hours.\n\nGive each PR a bounded retry budget of 3 total attempts (the initial\nrun plus at most 2 watchdog retries). The watchdog counts the retries\nit has already granted from a hidden marker in its own reset comments;\nonce the budget is spent it escalates the PR to the terminal\nstate:needs-human instead of resetting it again.\n\nPrompt change lives in qa-watchdog.md (runtime-imported); the lock is\nrecompiled so its body_hash matches. No other workflow behavior changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRL8KCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIU0QAH6vzKD2+gjp8BtvncQHxw+u\nDWkvbe8he4UPw64k7p8ba0EZqi4yJLwdUcx62hLCLXiGkFgwdeQ87Z5ziOGZQ4DM\nwRNF/Rf9EBelVetCkVBwzaHajEvmKXPJXxw2OShOgkPnmF0owpd+pJVdzvr70Gm5\n1mxfugTDzbvO1LAZNuHvBNlR0MID2hKhijRRN9cZzdIWWcxJaRgoG6anLMq4FMLL\n+hdx5MlMnhtrghJLEWNzOmWq6Ho5ZY9Hr78Qd94ZHHaYddnfWxNwUGcf6sh2LdUr\nwy6jHSUjzl9tWd27nywMnlJddwACmHXBhrdFh+xI4WmN30QPXEHSNYwddVMO03SH\nZdEtcd99ysiZUcsMS4yscuzbUjf5j3p2NOgeK32z8bUpdVHaxVYM1vnebIYqSDqV\n4kS664daTReR1JGsoH4o5LVqO7sGLiw/JqgATpa/QUcc53zEjicUFIk1mb29xWnt\nBrk/vcGvLdiDIcu5BveI7RF9b7hDMr36eDPgUo1JzBN2sneJ5l2TnMp7J0x1oecd\nEEWM9aVkAhjls0+XWP5F27G4h30zqJKAwssPruDXylz73iVrXc55Z5AN4GaEpgmb\nW2