.com/users/amjithtitus09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09","id":37619282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/b1ff03d4c6e2fe986ee78167abfad026f3c6cb88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:41:17Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:41:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"qa(playwright): scripted-spec runner + scoped ORM seeding + reusable spec artifact (#83)\n\nExtends the Visual QA workflow to match openclaw''s screenshot mechanism:\n- Primary capture path: the agent authors a self-contained tests/uiqa Playwright\n  config (no webServer/globalSetup; two chromium projects -> desktop 1366x768 and\n  mobile 390x844 both runner-enforced; JSON reporter) plus a focused spec that\n  asserts the changed element with expect(...) and screenshots both viewports.\n  Pre-agent step installs chromium so `npx playwright test` runs in-agent with no\n  egress; the proven playwright-cli flow remains a graceful fallback.\n- ORM-depth seeding, tightly scoped: allowlist only\n  `docker compose -f care/docker-compose.local.yaml exec -T backend python manage.py\n  {shell,loaddata,dumpdata}` so the agent can build object graphs REST can''t express.\n- Persists the authored spec + results as a `qa-spec-and-results` run artifact and\n  records the scenario path/method in the machine-readable payload + comment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0894d1d825fa6aa0a087053dae39e2a17d7389b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/c0894d1d825fa6aa0a087053dae39e2a17d7389b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/b1ff03d4c6e2fe986ee78167abfad026f3c6cb88","verification":{"payload":"tree c0894d1d825fa6aa0a087053dae39e2a17d7389b\nparent 7f54208496e5246056ac08bbe2a4fae2d9e5b7fb\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782808877 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782808877 +0530\n\nqa(playwright): scripted-spec runner + scoped ORM seeding + reusable spec artifact (#83)\n\nExtends the Visual QA workflow to match openclaw''s screenshot mechanism:\n- Primary capture path: the agent authors a self-contained tests/uiqa Playwright\n  config (no webServer/globalSetup; two chromium projects -> desktop 1366x768 and\n  mobile 390x844 both runner-enforced; JSON reporter) plus a focused spec that\n  asserts the changed element with expect(...) and screenshots both viewports.\n  Pre-agent step installs chromium so `npx playwright test` runs in-agent with no\n  egress; the proven playwright-cli flow remains a graceful fallback.\n- ORM-depth seeding, tightly scoped: allowlist only\n  `docker compose -f care/docker-compose.local.yaml exec -T backend python manage.py\n  {shell,loaddata,dumpdata}` so the agent can build object graphs REST can''t express.\n- Persists the authored spec + results as a `qa-spec-and-results` run artifact and\n  records the scenario path/method in the machine-readable payload + comment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQ4EtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3MEQAIOVgSV6UB8xgBVJM0YwIj30\nRhuCGwdFBs75bMMJHGcSErDYDyvWGauQLJX