:"9586e29391c8003073963f300be157b79e65c88e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/9586e29391c8003073963f300be157b79e65c88e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37619282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09","id":37619282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/d1d28e0472a35bf7d7f0080df476a1fea34a6a06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:32:43Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:32:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"QA: embed screenshots inline in the PR comment instead of [view] links (#69)\n\nThe Visual QA comment rendered each screenshot as a `[view](...)` link, so\nreviewers never saw the captured surfaces inline. Switch the comment template\nto embed every representative screenshot as a rendered image (`<img ... ?raw=true>`,\nwidth-capped per viewport), captioned by route + viewport. No link-only screenshots.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c7ac37fd9e2b6ad15ca1677c3166aaab19af989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/8c7ac37fd9e2b6ad15ca1677c3166aaab19af989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/d1d28e0472a35bf7d7f0080df476a1fea34a6a06","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c7ac37fd9e2b6ad15ca1677c3166aaab19af989\nparent 1e25ec0b0a768128e4471cf72711dffc7be241d5\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782664363 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782664363 +0530\n\nQA: embed screenshots inline in the PR comment instead of [view] links (#69)\n\nThe Visual QA comment rendered each screenshot as a `[view](...)` link, so\nreviewers never saw the captured surfaces inline. Switch the comment template\nto embed every representative screenshot as a rendered image (`<img ... ?raw=true>`,\nwidth-capped per viewport), captioned by route + viewport. No link-only screenshots.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQUyrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGfgQAFeVDoO6NGg2sueUiwbJ3m3z\nXv0+MhdDO7VpeH0Kb3UYDWfMAAeUdnY1pxzngPYZLGcoYKE+P4XiQB7Jk58XSr0S\nJiUrln6ywCsoT4irP63+Edw+MMjClwQw4Hd8Gs42jEn7O0W8OlTVyPhcKKSsHDmq\nqRaliiwrVsxH/hP9CPbwkGOHuzCN3IlR+IDS909Gem6CusCSEcCvF4/xAFSzvvQF\nibDmiNm1klJ41HggqC+mRo4HwePje0ZSZhrMK1/6UulGr+7mUN1ABoj509V7CyYS\npM+fkUfWl5ZHmCApGzTGEx25PL90Bgxqc4iz1hhuZBRLQn6/4PNtybGas2BNuoUe\nYEWVGabbeK8Byv/rHNIaHJS5Ep04LOYuGbQ7ptr63Jtkn+PP2N67ZMkHuOHhHHI6\n6yDqZzSTKc3Je9+md0B3qDmi6HOWy+nAER8X/uemZ5jEjiGKCDK8ZH1QRTuOkMlc\nwMnF8FFyj5VnzS/2llv4UuRLu2TYAtODqDSL9ElOKJwgt6A0ctPKDXfZPS7qkK54\nf8tqrNFTE8i/BhCfSSoSUjjEqIF59KLm/34gEPFuIX8EEhBnJbsuSReDClWwzuzw\nCaiWLTkkK5nO2Fz4iCF7V0AweBVNmacZAkvsvJey5yhnUP7xNcmHangdPLVDSwQw\np2txlropCLs2mjkDQG67\n=CZcT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-28T16:32:44Z"}},"committer":{"a