9282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/1e25ec0b0a768128e4471cf72711dffc7be241d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:28:30Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:28:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Harden Visual QA against runaway loops and provider token TTL (#67)\n\nPR #66''s QA died after 12m26s / 5.7M tokens when the model-provider token expired\nmid-run (HTTP 403). Root causes, all fixed:\n\n- python3 was not allow-listed, so the agent burned ~10 turns retrying denied\n  `python3 -c` calls while assembling the PR comment. Allow python3 (+ arg''d\n  head/tail/grep/wc) and tell the agent it can pass markdown straight to add-comment\n  without hand-building JSON or shelling out.\n- The agent chained compound shell one-liners (a; b || c) that the sandbox denies by\n  design. Instruct it to run simple, single commands.\n- The agent tried to construct a unit-bearing questionnaire to reach the exact ENG-614\n  state — a slow, failure-prone detour. Forbid manufacturing data; use existing\n  fixtures only and screenshot the closest real surface.\n- Lower max-turns 60 -> 30 to bound wall-clock under the provider token TTL.\n\nThe successful baseline run finished the agent in ~1m; these keep it there.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe98bb6f7623b7a93f0f9a0ee754d0d0ed368a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/fe98bb6f7623b7a93f0f9a0ee754d0d0ed368a87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/1e25ec0b0a768128e4471cf72711dffc7be241d5","verification":{"payload":"tree fe98bb6f7623b7a93f0f9a0ee754d0d0ed368a87\nparent 692b5595e33bd4e42d71045193d473a18272d8fd\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782660510 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782660510 +0530\n\nHarden Visual QA against runaway loops and provider token TTL (#67)\n\nPR #66''s QA died after 12m26s / 5.7M tokens when the model-provider token expired\nmid-run (HTTP 403). Root causes, all fixed:\n\n- python3 was not allow-listed, so the agent burned ~10 turns retrying denied\n  `python3 -c` calls while assembling the PR comment. Allow python3 (+ arg''d\n  head/tail/grep/wc) and tell the agent it can pass markdown straight to add-comment\n  without hand-building JSON or shelling out.\n- The agent chained compound shell one-liners (a; b || c) that the sandbox denies by\n  design. Instruct it to run simple, single commands.\n- The agent tried to construct a unit-bearing questionnaire to reach the exact ENG-614\n  state — a slow, failure-prone detour. Forbid manufacturing data; use existing\n  fixtures only and screenshot the closest real surface.\n- Lower max-turns 60 -> 30 to bound wall-clock under the provider token TTL.\n\nThe successful baseline run finished the agent in ~1m; these keep it there.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQT2eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB7YQADmYMbUSyHz+Kn1JBp/QKYTL\n05iNZwfLCBCr9rXF24IhLJj4ZtkRjcMkRXag2GQ8Tp0riHjBWxY5xurfutghorIX\n/PmjbEVEwpacntJZuwbBO80DsM3uGfxmpt5HOTrzkjKNhRT3ilSjUIqEB1LUDJhu\n4Z29dNI74T+PvxMT9m2D1/mFkzgqMpZXvL+Z2YD/JGt