"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/cb6227402b4e7677dc7443e70cc13a50f0ebc383"}],"sha":"7397f0c9ccfdf9e8d0220d882417df12a7b13363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/7397f0c9ccfdf9e8d0220d882417df12a7b13363"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37619282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09","id":37619282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/cb6227402b4e7677dc7443e70cc13a50f0ebc383/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:57:30Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:57:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(gh-aw): capture real Playwright screenshots in PR visual QA (#46)\n\nThe QA agent runs inside the gh-aw firewall sandbox, where node/npm are\nunavailable and the browser can reach the runner only via\nhost.docker.internal on ports 80/443/8080 (8080 is the MCP gateway). So:\n\n- Build the PR head and serve it in a pre-agent runner step (the agent\n  never builds), serving the vite build/ output dir (not dist/) on\n  privileged port 80 via \"serve -s\" (no Host-header allowlist, unlike\n  vite preview).\n- Point the agent''s Playwright CLI browser at http://host.docker.internal/.\n- Gracefully report (not crash) when the PR fails to build.\n\nValidated end-to-end: the agent now captures and uploads real screenshots\nof the landing/login flow across mobile/tablet/desktop viewports and posts\na severity-ranked PR comment with the image URLs.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"42c13a439d8464ec44b71448d97b9ab6bbb3bc4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/42c13a439d8464ec44b71448d97b9ab6bbb3bc4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/cb6227402b4e7677dc7443e70cc13a50f0ebc383","verification":{"payload":"tree 42c13a439d8464ec44b71448d97b9ab6bbb3bc4a\nparent d01482a94c5217e73af841671b24a9a593e06352\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782489450 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782489450 +0530\n\nci(gh-aw): capture real Playwright screenshots in PR visual QA (#46)\n\nThe QA agent runs inside the gh-aw firewall sandbox, where node/npm are\nunavailable and the browser can reach the runner only via\nhost.docker.internal on ports 80/443/8080 (8080 is the MCP gateway). So:\n\n- Build the PR head and serve it in a pre-agent runner step (the agent\n  never builds), serving the vite build/ output dir (not dist/) on\n  privileged port 80 via \"serve -s\" (no Host-header allowlist, unlike\n  vite preview).\n- Point the agent''s Playwright CLI browser at http://host.docker.internal/.\n- Gracefully report (not crash) when the PR fails to build.\n\nValidated end-to-end: the agent now captures and uploads real screenshots\nof the landing/login flow across mobile/tablet/desktop viewports and posts\na severity-ranked PR comment with the image URLs.\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot