ew -> QA -> rework loop into the repo''s existing label state machine (pr-automation.yml), fix the lockdown activation gate (min-integrity: approved), un-skip the managed Copilot agent''s PRs, and add a shared rework cap. Fork-only pilot.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c54189238e13d7d7f2886777fbfea823a0cab2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/9c54189238e13d7d7f2886777fbfea823a0cab2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/d01482a94c5217e73af841671b24a9a593e06352","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c54189238e13d7d7f2886777fbfea823a0cab2f\nparent a052c88f2f656ca5851548ef11d33ad1a00c67ff\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782472257 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782472257 +0530\n\nci(gh-aw): label-driven PR review/QA/rework loop (+ activation fix) (#37)\n\nWire the gh-aw review -> QA -> rework loop into the repo''s existing label state machine (pr-automation.yml), fix the lockdown activation gate (min-integrity: approved), un-skip the managed Copilot agent''s PRs, and add a shared rework cap. Fork-only pilot.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPl5BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP0oQAANOG2gBqKh6q17J8uHpUmAy\nGHIFKqge+7dwRQQwsO666DWMHxLhoUEZpg+OhcmuNNxhQVOtA6+EqapVEo4migy/\nCLevIiXgpY/KVEvzX/aBGRbFwjzZ42iem5bctt4WgbBraFW7K1ID8iwdrKJgywBG\nJPGUrVKw5qv/8WdjZtCQx1VyR7dQhiIBAKVIMq51VK/gte633Xx1XlfBHDEyg9bV\nu+UqDucMoQ9OD03L8ZmvN0y3ITuvtks7z91yFvm6zf3L7RZE5MAk6Q3XoLYQpPvi\nFSP21/f6Fqi78Ihxc1fBAplTmtlAqXwqVGzc2TgT/jRVrgrI0nU9r0QRVtU9A4Sd\n5sHdF6wrAcIJuPYlfSo09lsVVzr+qFjBWnyG0qBYQGNoOQrMxIHL077sgIJzKfXB\ntBLelJOS12dmG2+Z57qIhsXueo9M6v6+8fcsWoE55hpsKrW1QL0lCFJPbgv977l4\nKJn393rkKas500S/hMv4hUOFyZdVwq7mOdrC1nlETFnbZpjQY6V7CEL+a+ntO92+\nmm/6vlLZU+0q2GDWBI8IqB0+8p0kphW1koxU5Zbp4jcFIRPbJDAa206vtoqfpQaA\nrOjBg0vG86IqMog5xdP9iH3FMNmdfjAA