19282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commit/a052c88f2f656ca5851548ef11d33ad1a00c67ff","node_id":"C_kwDONbM8otoAKGEwNTJjODhmMmY2NTZjYTU4NTE1NDhlZjExZDMzYWQxYTAwYzY3ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commit/6bc1b1d056c3e4f9b3596e4a17eb330069e301e9","sha":"6bc1b1d056c3e4f9b3596e4a17eb330069e301e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/6bc1b1d056c3e4f9b3596e4a17eb330069e301e9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commit/7e0c01fb5e52b2f906a92a8904f61763ca30c34b","sha":"7e0c01fb5e52b2f906a92a8904f61763ca30c34b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/7e0c01fb5e52b2f906a92a8904f61763ca30c34b"}],"sha":"a052c88f2f656ca5851548ef11d33ad1a00c67ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/a052c88f2f656ca5851548ef11d33ad1a00c67ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37619282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amjithtitus09","id":37619282,"login":"amjithtitus09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjE5Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amjithtitus09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/commits/7e0c01fb5e52b2f906a92a8904f61763ca30c34b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:23:41Z","email":"amjithtitus09@gmail.com","name":"Amjith Titus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:23:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: authorize Copilot coding agent in gh-aw activation gate (#34)\n\nThe managed Copilot-for-Jira agent opens PRs as the `Copilot` actor\n(`copilot-swe-agent[bot]` App), which holds no repository role. gh-aw''s\npre_activation membership check therefore denied the agent job on those\nPRs (404 \"Copilot is not a user\"), so pr-reviewer ran but skipped its\nagent and posted nothing (observed on PR #33).\n\nAdd the agent to each workflow''s `on.bots:` allowlist so gh-aw verifies\nthe bot App is installed/active and authorizes activation:\n- pr-reviewer: auto-review the agent''s PRs on opened/synchronize\n- pr-qa-playwright: re-run QA on the agent''s follow-up pushes after a\n  human opts the PR in with the `jira-agent` label\n\nci-doctor is intentionally unchanged: gh-aw v0.80.9 rejects `bots:`/\n`roles:` combined with a `workflow_run` trigger at compile time, so the\nbot actor cannot be allowlisted there yet (documented in the PR body).\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"15026176d076d939b2abf06b9f4a851d5d3d3389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/trees/15026176d076d939b2abf06b9f4a851d5d3d3389"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amjithtitus09/care_fe/git/commits/7e0c01fb5e52b2f906a92a8904f61763ca30c34b","verification":{"payload":"tree 15026176d076d939b2abf06b9f4a851d5d3d3389\nparent e40153cd9cc1ab07c7b7996791d43f6c8f7e7988\nauthor Amjith Titus <amjithtitus09@gmail.com> 1782379421 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782379421 +0530\n\nci: authorize Copilot coding agent in gh-aw activation gate (#34)\n\nThe managed Copilot-for-Jira agent opens PRs as the `Copilot` actor\n(`copilot-swe-agent[bot]` App), which holds no repository role. gh-aw''s\npre_activation membership check therefore denied the agent job on those\nPRs (404 \"Copilot is not a user\"), so pr-reviewer ran but skipped its\nagent and posted nothing (observed on PR #33).\n\nAdd the agent to each workflow''s `on.bots:` allowlist so gh-aw verifies\nthe bot App is installed/active and authorizes activation:\n- pr-reviewer: auto-review the agent''s PRs on opened/synchronize\n- pr-qa-playwright: re-run QA on the agent''s follow-up pushes after a\n  human opts the PR in with the `jira-agent` label\n\nci-doctor is intentionally unchanged: gh-aw v0.80.9 rejects `bots:`/\n`roles:` combined with a `workflow_run` trigger at compile time, so the\nbot actor cannot be allowlisted there yet (documented in the PR body).\n\nCo-authored-by: carefe-bot <bot@care.local>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPPOdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANzAQAHXu9r2Th4VPYUuGIk+ZJ0Ah\nGLjnRox55QCI7cMCmnzapw8N+y+yDx6ZP+o400yopjs3WaDYg9V3pP+IlCvSN12/\nKn5Mjla/S8x2GwWKx5W6Aeq5W8K+JedLNxfwfNOUsJznHCcNr6Le8fMgqrkhgm99\n9X9v7+d56yzuZ/qVTHaidrIGSeKekm6wX8vhp4oijSRg0QSAqPtYyGL2Wgn+dtEm\n/pTGm4BVcVy9DVS4XISKffMuNT3Pc459Zh1O4a3oiSUPMkdYN9yleqgFCfun20fl\njIvJXg05QkMDjEguDDvXYzDPbHzQV+BfDhj9P2BNx8McVahD5RSpTFKhfSOOZ8dD\nsxe/WPHz16klC5fz8JZvdxdhuTIAdqbfuUBS4hyeL4N2/3pEkpWdMdRB8lmYng6A\nnfU/KagaOG9KDUzM2r0if2vZ+I59KpTUzW