 tiles from span 4 to span 6 so the bottom row fills the 12-col\n  grid again, and drop the now-unused .tile.compact rule\n- Rewrite the section lede: four projects, all browser-only\n\nPositioning:\n- Drop WebLLM/WebGPU/Transformers.js from meta description, og:description, the\n  now block, the skills tree, and all project stack chips and descriptions\n- Remove React and FastAPI throughout: hero bio, meta tags, portrait card stack,\n  the now block''s \"range\" row, and the skills tree (react row, range/ group)\n- Move web workers into frontend/ as off-main-thread compute\n- Hero bio and meta tags rebuilt around Angular, TypeScript, RxJS, NgRx\n\nREADME:\n- Match the site: Software Engineer (was Senior Angular Engineer), Precision\n  Ledger (was Ledger Stream), Angular v7->v19 (was v12->v19), charlit641@ email\n- Rewrite project table to match the cards; add accessibility and web workers\n  to the skills tiers; drop the AHU entry","tree":{"sha":"c68f1d61d5c81e588c19618ec3e92e0e95bb05ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelopStudios/charl-portfolio/git/trees/c68f1d61d5c81e588c19618ec3e92e0e95bb05ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelopStudios/charl-portfolio/git/commits/c018a6316121642b1c370c4fb33cb528fbcb7106","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26139989?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevelopStudios/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevelopStudios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevelopStudios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevelopStudios/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DevelopStudios","id":26139989,"login":"DevelopStudios","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTM5OTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevelopStudios/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/De